            "review_title": "Review at Shamoji Robata Yaki",
            "review_text": "Sunshine48897384929\n2 contributions\n0\nTop spots to pick up\nFeb 2026 • Solo\nI often bring Japanese partners here, and they all rave about the environment that’s very similar to their hometown. From the layout to the taste of the dish, it’s Japanese. The items in the Set Shamoji are beautifully presented in luxury. While it’s a lively pub style, there are courteous corners for a mix of dining.\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten February 28, 2026",
